    tools='''<div class="container"><div class="pagehead"><div class="eyebrow">FREE TOOLS / NO ACCOUNT</div><h1>自己记录，自己验证。</h1><p>数据仅存在当前浏览器本地；不上传服务器。建议每次测试后导出 CSV，以免清理浏览器数据后丢失。</p></div><div class="tool-grid"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">AI VISIBILITY LOG</div><h2>手动记录测试结果</h2><form id="visibilityForm"><div class="formgrid"><div><label class="field" for="testDate">测试日期</label><input id="testDate" class="input" name="date" type="date" required></div><div><label class="field" for="platform">平台</label><select id="platform" name="platform"><option>ChatGPT Search</option><option>Google AI Overviews</option><option>Google AI Mode</option><option>Bing/Copilot</option><option>其他</option></select></div><div><label class="field" for="region">测试地区与语言</label><input class="input" id="region" name="region" placeholder="例如：台湾/繁体中文"></div><div><label class="field" for="phase">测试阶段</label><select id="phase" name="phase"><option value="baseline">发布前基线</option><option value="after">发布后复测</option></select></div><div><label class="field" for="kind">问题类型</label><select id="kind" name="kind"><option value="natural">自然提问（不含本品牌）</option><option value="brand">品牌直搜（单独统计）</option></select></div><div><label class="field" for="triggered">是否实际触发 AI 回答</label><select id="triggered" name="triggered"><option value="yes">是</option><option value="no">未触发，排除分母</option></select></div><div class="full"><label class="field" for="query">原始问题（自然提问不要带自家品牌词）</label><textarea id="query" name="query" required placeholder="例如：一家中型制造企业，如何选 AI 培训与咨询公司？"></textarea></div><div><label class="field" for="mention">答案是否提到品牌</label><select id="mention" name="mention"><option value="no">否</option><option value="yes">是</option></select></div><div><label class="field" for="citation">是否引用自己的真实 URL</label><select id="citation" name="citation"><option value="no">否</option><option value="yes">是</option></select></div><div class="full"><label class="field" for="url">真实引用 URL（如有）</label><input class="input" type="url" id="url" name="url" placeholder="https://…"></div><div class="full"><label class="field" for="evidence">截图 / 证据链接</label><input class="input" id="evidence" name="evidence" placeholder="内部文件路径或链接"></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">保存一条测试</button></div></form></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">SELF AUDIT / NOT A CRAWLER</div><h2>十项对抗式自检</h2><div class="kpi" id="auditScore">0 / 10</div><p class="tiny" id="auditNote">自我检查不代表自动检测。</p><div id="auditChecklist" class="checklist">'''+''.join(f'<label><input type="checkbox" data-audit="{i}"> {H(t)}</label>' for i,t in enumerate(audit_items,1))+'''</div><div class="notice">建议把未通过项写入 GitHub Issue，附页面 URL、截图及复现步骤。</div></div></div><section class="section"><div class="panel"><div class="row"><h2>本机记录概览</h2><div class="actions" style="margin:0"><button class="btn" type="button" id="exportCsv">导出 CSV</button><button class="btn alt" type="button" id="clearLog">清空</button></div></div><div class="statbar"><div class="stat"><strong id="logN">0</strong><span>有效自然提问样本</span></div><div class="stat"><strong id="logMention">—</strong><span>品牌提及率</span></div><div class="stat"><strong id="logCitation">—</strong><span>自有 URL 引用率</span></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>平台</th><th>自然问题</th><th>提及</th><th>引用</th></tr></thead><tbody id="logTable"></tbody></table></div><p class="tiny">仅统计本机手动录入的“自然提问且已触发 AI 回答”的样本。未触发与品牌直搜单独保留在明细中，不计入此处比率；不能推断全网展示概率。</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="dark"><h2>搭好第一个真实实验。</h2><p>先建立 30 问题库，再记录发布前基线、技术修改、内容改动和复测日期。不要只关注一个“AI 推荐率”数字。</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="templates.html" style="background:#eef7f0;color:#173c2d">复制模板 ↗</a><a class="btn alt" href="30days.html" style="color:#fff;border-color:#597565">按 30 天计划做</a></div></div></section></div>'''
